Third-party components
----------------------
Nothing in this notice limits the rights you have under the licence of a third-party
component. Cuelight links FFmpeg's decoders statically under the GNU Lesser General Public
License 2.1: you may modify Cuelight for your own use and reverse engineer it to debug
such modifications, and you may relink it against a modified FFmpeg, as that licence
provides. Everything needed to rebuild it is in this repository (see README.md,
"Building", tools/ffmpeg.sh and tools/ffmpeg-player.sh).

